    fix(web): retry administrator loading for payer transfers
    
    Allow retrying member discovery for the selected organisation without
    resetting it or invoking quote or transfer APIs. Keep discovery errors
    separate and prevent overlapping requests with an immediate lock.
    
    Cover pending retries, repeated failures, empty responses, selection
    resets and quote/submission error isolation with component tests.
    
